  "id": "2088281320422322413",
  "text": "The king of small models is back! Qwen3.8-27B from @Alibaba_Qwen is open source, and Day-0 support is live in SGLang:\n- 206.1 tok/s decode on a single RTX 5090, with our NVFP4 plus DSpark\n- 38.28 tok/s decode on DGX Spark\nQwen3.8-27B raises the bar again for what a small model can do on agentic planning and long-horizon tasks.\n\nLong live the (small model) king! Run it locally with SGLang 👇",
  "raw_text": {
